{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39675","headline":"东山之游未遂渐逼行期作四十字奉寄翁文尧员外 · 黄滔","name":"东山之游未遂渐逼行期作四十字奉寄翁文尧员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轺车难久驻，须到别离时。\n北阙定归去，东山空作期。\n绿苔劳扫径，丹凤欲衔词。\n杨柳开帆岸，今朝泪已垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}